{"runId":"basic-pilot-i1-in02-01-20260907","accountLabel":"I1","groupId":"IN02","area":"Inspection","preconditions":["仅当当前会话确认 Inspection Manager 具有 Team Tasks 权限且页面布局匹配时执行本组；本组不是 Inspector 的基线流程。"],"step":3,"question":"What is the difference between Assigned Time and Last Update on these team tasks?","expectedOutcome":"仅对已确认 Team Tasks 的 manager 布局解释两个队列各自实际显示的时间字段；不得把 Assigned Time 或 Last Update 换成未观察的时间语义或日期边界。","conversationId":"conv_0a9000b048a04590a9c8","accepted":true,"duplicate":false,"timedOut":false,"maxSeq":30,"durationMs":16914,"skillId":"admin_portal_reader","category":"portal_reader","reader":{"result":"success","page":"","section":"","sourceSection":"","selectedState":"","scope":"unknown","workflowState":"","answerShape":"unspecified","completeness":"bounded","facts":["Assigned Time is specific to the Inspector Tasks 'To Do' list and is not Last Update.","Last Update is specific to the Team Tasks 'Completed' list and is not Queued Tasks Creation Time or Team Tasks To Do Assigned Time."],"missing":[]},"plan":{"facts":[],"missing":[]},"actionEvidence":[],"answer":"Assigned Time and Last Update are different time fields that apply to different task lists:\n\n- **Assigned Time** is the field used on the **Inspector Tasks 'To Do'** list; it records when a task was assigned.\n- **Last Update** is the field used on the **Team Tasks 'Completed'** list; it records when that task was last updated.\n\nIn addition, Last Update is **not** the creation time of queued tasks and is **not** the Assigned Time shown on the Team Tasks 'To Do' list. So the two fields are not interchangeable—they represent distinct moments in different task contexts.","terminalEvent":"turn.completed","eventTypes":["user.message","turn.started","assistant.status","skill.route","reader.result","assistant.message","turn.completed"],"auditEvidence":[{"recordType":"reader.evidence","category":"dsh","payload":{"facts":[],"missing":[],"stage":"knowledge_only","qualityTrace":[{"stage":"question_co